4. Added the mock to the window object in a way that can't be overwritten
5. Improved the component structure to better handle potential errors
6. Added data-testid for better debugging

Key improvements in this approach:
1. Uses React Context to provide the mock, which is more reliable than global injection
2. Multiple layers of error handling to catch issues at different levels
